2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires:-
(a)
"Act" means the Haj Committee Act, 2002;
(b)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Committee;
(c)
"Committee" means the Rajasthan State Haj Committee constituted under section 18 of the Act;
(d)
"Section" means the section of the Act;
(e)
"State Government" means the Rajasthan Government;
(f)
"Retired employees" means an employee retired from the service of Rajasthan Government/ Central Government or
Corporations thereunder;
(g)
The words and expressions used in these rules and not defined but defined in the Act shall have the respective
meanings assigned to them in the Act.
